# The project: link_orge

We will build a small local integration platform called **link_forge**.

The point is NOT to clone Merge.
The point is to learn the engineering problems a unified integration platform must solve.

Use:
- Python 3.12+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic
- httpx
- pytest
- PostgreSQL
- psycopg (or SQLAlchemy only after I understand the SQL)
- Redis only in later phases if needed
- Docker only after the app works locally

Prefer local mock third-party APIs so I can see every failure mode.

Suggested repo:

```text
link_forge/
  app/
    main.py
    models.py
    db.py
    api/
      webhooks.py
      employees.py
      connections.py
    providers/
      base.py
      acme_hr.py
      beta_hr.py
