# Mental model I must internalize

A realistic unified integration flow looks roughly like:

```text
Customer app
   |
   | connect provider
   v
Authorization / credential exchange
   |
   v
Linked connection + stored token
   |
   v
Third-party API
   |
   | raw provider-specific data
   v
Provider adapter
   |
   v
Normalization
   |
   v
Common model
   |
   v
Database / customer API
```

Changes can arrive through:

```text
third-party webhook ---> our webhook receiver
                              |
                              v
                           queue/job
                              |
                              v
                       fetch changed data
                              |
                              v
                         normalize/upsert
```

But webhooks are not enough by themselves. We will also learn polling/reconciliation.

